{"metadata":{"title":"The Mysterious Island","author":"AI","language":"English","difficulty":"A2"},"content":[["Captain Reed","sailed across","the stormy ocean","for many weeks.","Suddenly, a massive fog","covered the water,","hiding everything","around his ship."],["When the fog","finally disappeared,","an unknown island","appeared ahead.","Tall palm trees","swayed in the wind,","and strange golden lights","shone from a cave."],["He dropped anchor","and stepped","onto the white sand.","An ancient stone map","lay on a rock,","waiting for","a brave explorer","to find it."]]}